BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 307 Td (their role, their routine and their team. That difference in view explains most of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 292 Td (friction. In this lecture we will look at why people resist change, how to explain the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 277 Td (reason for it in plain language, how to spot resistance early, and how to keep) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 262 Td (momentum going after the launch, which is where many programmes quietly fade.) Tj ET
