BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 161 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 146 Td (- They doubt it will be seen through) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 131 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 116 Td (Resistance is usually information. People resist when they expect to lose something,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 101 Td (such as status, familiar routines or relationships. They resist when they do not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 86 Td (understand why the change is happening, so it feels arbitrary. And they resist when) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 71 Td (they have seen earlier changes started and abandoned, so they doubt this one will) Tj ET
