BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 404 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 389 Td (Most change efforts fade after the launch. Energy drops, attention moves on, and old) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 374 Td (habits return. To keep momentum, make progress visible. A simple board or a short) Tj ET
